graph LR
    Input((Grid Metrics)) --> Sensor[Sense: IoT Data]
    Sensor --> Brain[Think: EMS & Optimization]
    Brain --> Decision{Action Needed?}
    Decision -- Yes --> Actuator[Act: Relay/Inverter Control]
    Decision -- No --> Monitor[Continue Monitoring]
    Actuator --> Feedback((New Grid State))
    Feedback --> Input